<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10059" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντι-κρούω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strike</i> or <i>clash against, come into
			collision,</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> in a physical sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλίγα . . τὰ ἀντικρούοντα αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cael.</u>
					313b2
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				642a36
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				857c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπὶς ἀσπίδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					37.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in a general
			sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοῖς . . τοῦτο ἀντεκεκρούκει</span>
			<i>had been a hindrance to</i> them, <i>had counteracted</i>
			them, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.46
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῖς λογισμοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.4.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ταῖς συμβουλίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>prove a hindrance, offer resistance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντέκρουσέ τι καὶ γέγον᾽ οἷον οὐκ
					ἔδει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.198
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐαν ἀντικρούσῃ τις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1379a12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντέκρουον αἱ γυναῖκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1270a7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
